<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<Patch>

	<!--
		Metabolic retuning of four genes, all of it gated on Alpha Genes in the original and kept that way here.
		- Chocolate production stops overriding the carrier's meat and costs one metabolism instead of two.
		- Giant weapon wielder costs two metabolism instead of none.
		- The Alpha Genes tough sinews gene gains nine archite points.
		- With Roo's Minotaur Xenotype also active, giant weapon wielder loses its first mod extension, which is the
		prerequisite block requiring strong melee damage or the B&amp;S psychic warrior gene.
		This folder only loads when B&amp;S - Genes &amp; More is active (see loadFolders.xml); the partner mods are gated
		inside.
		The mod gate sits on an <li> inside a sequence, not on the <Operation> itself: RimWorld reads
		MayRequire only on list elements, so an <Operation MayRequire="..."> node loads and applies
		unconditionally.

		Verified against the current 1.6 releases: chocolate production has a Chocolate meatOverride and biostatMet -2,
		giant weapon wielder has biostatMet 0 and its first mod extension is the prerequisite block, and AG_ToughSinews
		has no biostatArc, so every operation lands.

		Two things worth revisiting:
		- The chocolate and giant-weapon metabolism numbers have nothing to do with Alpha Genes, but the original
		author put them inside an Alpha Genes check, so they only apply when it is installed.
		- The archite cost on AG_ToughSinews never applies if the Convergence mod's Cherry Picker list is left
		  unchecked, because that list retires AG_ToughSinews. The list is opt-in, so the cost still matters for
		  anyone who does not use it.
	-->
	<Operation Class="PatchOperationSequence">
		<operations>
			<li Class="PatchOperationSequence" MayRequire="sarg.alphagenes">
				<operations>
					<li Class="PatchOperationRemove">
						<xpath>Defs/GeneDef[defName="BS_ChocolateProduction"]/modExtensions/li[@Class="BigAndSmall.PawnExtension"]/meatOverride</xpath>
					</li>
					<li Class="PatchOperationReplace">
						<xpath>Defs/GeneDef[defName="BS_ChocolateProduction"]/biostatMet</xpath>
						<value>
							<biostatMet>-1</biostatMet>
						</value>
					</li>
					<li Class="PatchOperationReplace">
						<xpath>Defs/GeneDef[defName="BS_GiantWeaponWielder"]/biostatMet</xpath>
						<value>
							<biostatMet>-2</biostatMet>
						</value>
					</li>
					<li Class="PatchOperationAdd">
						<xpath>Defs/GeneDef[defName="AG_ToughSinews"]</xpath>
						<value>
							<biostatArc>9</biostatArc>
						</value>
					</li>
					<li Class="PatchOperationSequence" MayRequire="tug.minotaur">
						<operations>
							<li Class="PatchOperationRemove">
								<xpath>Defs/GeneDef[defName="BS_GiantWeaponWielder"]/modExtensions/li[position()=1]</xpath>
							</li>
						</operations>
					</li>
				</operations>
			</li>
		</operations>
	</Operation>

</Patch>
